Description: Share Disk Ubuntu storage agent and CLI
 Share Disk is a personal distributed cloud drive that keeps file contents on
 user devices. This package installs the Ubuntu storage Agent
 (share-disk-agent, managed by systemd) and the command line interface
 (share-disk-cli).
 .
 The Agent is the sole writer of local object bytes and SQLite metadata, and
 exposes a local Unix-socket IPC for the CLI plus an opt-in authenticated LAN
 data plane for Android uploads/downloads. File contents are never uploaded to
 the control server.
